//! task: fix
//! ask: Declare a public function that returns its argument.
//! expect: EXS-E0201
//! refs: §8.4
//! explain: `funtcio` is a misspelling of the reserved word `functio`. The compiler recognises it as a near miss of a keyword in the closed thirty-word set and attaches the note "did you mean the reserved word functio".

publica funtcio identica(a: u64) -> u64 {
    redde a;
}
//@ fixed
publica functio identica(a: u64) -> u64 {
    redde a;
}
